<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets call warrants on SBC.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets call warrants on SBC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank J. Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants, on registered shares of Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    280 CHF		   PREMIUM	11.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.94 CHF		  GEARING	13.8 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.FEB.97-16.SEP.98   PAYDATE	14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  269 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
